      "writtenOn": "2025-08-19T18:51:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this may warrant being turned into an enum at this point. Advanced blends hadn\u0027t been implemented when I first mocked up the toKey function.\n\nAnything with a dst read or an advanced blend must also have dependsOnDst \u003d true.  An advanced blend may or may not have dst read being true. This could be represented as an enum + SkEnumBitmask like:\n\n    enum class PaintDstUsage : uint8_t {\n        kNone \u003d 0b000,\n        kDependsOnDst \u003d 0b001,\n        kDstReadReq \u003d 0b011,   // Includes kDependsOnDst automatically\n        kAdvancedBlend \u003d 0b101 // \"\"\n    };",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 74,
        "startChar": 30,
        "endLine": 76,
