      "writtenOn": "2025-08-19T18:51:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These are doing the same purpose as the existing `endPaintData()` and `rewindForRenderStep()`.  If needed we should just expand how those work, or adjust where they are called from to handle the multi-draw case.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 350,
